w: 1.~O that the Lord would guide my ways To keep His sta- tutes still! 
w: 2.~O send Thy Spi- rit down to write Thy law up- on my heart! 
w: 3.~From van- i- ty turn off mine eyes; Let no cor- rupt de- sign, 
w: 4.~Or- der my foot- steps by Thy Word, And make my heart sin- cere; 
w: 5.~My soul hath gone too far a- stray, My feet too of- ten slip;
w: 6.~Make me to walk in Thy com- mands, 'Tis a de- ligh- tful road;
